# Cursor already skips .gitignore paths and a default list (node_modules,
# lockfiles, images). Listed again so a window that misses .gitignore still
# cannot open them. Terminal output is unaffected: a command can still print
# a file. See the workspace doc docs/agent-workflow.md.

node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
logs/
.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo
openapi.json
package-lock.json

# Secrets
.secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Tracked binaries
assets/demo-media/
